  "description": "Railway-oriented pipelines for .NET: a train chains junctions (small single-purpose classes), passes each one the cargo it needs from the train's type-keyed memory, and stops at the first failure, returning Either<Exception, T>. Install it on its own for in-process pipelines; add Trax.Effect for dependency injection, execution logging and persistence.",
